{"id":"2a94e54a928b642a","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-cut-rule.md","title":"Cut Rule","display":"df-cut-rule — Cut Rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-cut-rule","aliases":["72-df-cut-rule"],"display":"df-cut-rule — Cut Rule","depends_on":["[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §1.2.2 print11/PDF23; context-splitting equivalent presentation","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_2026_10_22":"显式绑定全部切公式，直接构造带标签四元切实例"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-cut-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-cut-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cut-rule — Cut Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §1.2.2 print11/PDF23; context-splitting equivalent presentation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"显式绑定全部切公式，直接构造带标签四元切实例"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 的五分量签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\">\\(X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>有限序列以自然数为定义域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A\">\\(\\Gamma,A\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\">\\(\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\Gamma\">\\(A,\\Gamma\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma\\)</span>。多个逗号按次序串接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a> 的语法有序对。</li>\n<li>本文件的规则名均指推理实例关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CutInst}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,A):=\n\\left\\langle\\left\\langle(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A),(A,\\Gamma&#39;\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta&#39;)\\right\\rangle,\n(\\Gamma,\\Gamma&#39;\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;)\\right\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CutInst}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,A):=\n\\left\\langle\\left\\langle(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A),(A,\\Gamma&#39;\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta&#39;)\\right\\rangle,\n(\\Gamma,\\Gamma&#39;\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;)\\right\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cut}_\\Sigma:=\\{\\operatorname{CutInst}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,A):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in X_\\Sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cut}_\\Sigma:=\\{\\operatorname{CutInst}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,A):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in X_\\Sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma:=\n\\{\\langle\\mathsf{cut},A,\\langle(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A),(A,\\Gamma&#39;\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta&#39;)\\rangle,\n(\\Gamma,\\Gamma&#39;\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;)\\rangle:\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in X_\\Sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma:=\n\\{\\langle\\mathsf{cut},A,\\langle(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A),(A,\\Gamma&#39;\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta&#39;)\\rangle,\n(\\Gamma,\\Gamma&#39;\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;)\\rangle:\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in X_\\Sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\mathsf{cut},A,p,q\\rangle):=\\operatorname{rk}(A)\n\\quad(\\langle\\mathsf{cut},A,p,q\\rangle\\in\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rank}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\mathsf{cut},A,p,q\\rangle):=\\operatorname{rk}(A)\n\\quad(\\langle\\mathsf{cut},A,p,q\\rangle\\in\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不带标签CutInst严格是〈前提序列,结论〉；切公式保存在带标签四元实例的第二分量，避免旧三元实例与通用RuleSpace不兼容。切公式不会仅由根结论或无标签规则关系反推。结论拼接两组上下文；与书中共享上下文形式通过弱化/收缩/交换互相模拟。</p>\n<p>2026-10-22：切公式A现在显式在XΣ中量化，前提族与结论整体分组；带标签集合直接构造四元组，避免自由A及间接解构p/q使规则集依赖隐含参数。rank仅在已构造的合法切实例域上定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$ 是 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 的五分量签名；$X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)$，$\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma',\\Delta'$ 遍历 $\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma$，$A,B$ 遍历 $X_\\Sigma$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有限序列以自然数为定义域，$\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}$；$\\Gamma,A$ 缩写 $\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle$，$A,\\Gamma$ 缩写 $\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma$。多个逗号按次序串接。$\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma$ 是 [[72-df-sequent-calculus]] 的语法有序对。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本文件的规则名均指推理实例关系；$\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle$，$\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle$，见 [[72-df-sequent-rule]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma',\\Delta'","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A,\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CutInst}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma',\\Delta',A):=\n\\left\\langle\\left\\langle(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A),(A,\\Gamma'\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta')\\right\\rangle,\n(\\Gamma,\\Gamma'\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\Delta')\\right\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cut}_\\Sigma:=\\{\\operatorname{CutInst}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma',\\Delta',A):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma',\\Delta'\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in X_\\Sigma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma:=\n\\{\\langle\\mathsf{cut},A,\\langle(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A),(A,\\Gamma'\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta')\\rangle,\n(\\Gamma,\\Gamma'\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\Delta')\\rangle:\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma',\\Delta'\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in X_\\Sigma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rank}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\mathsf{cut},A,p,q\\rangle):=\\operatorname{rk}(A)\n\\quad(\\langle\\mathsf{cut},A,p,q\\rangle\\in\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma).","display":true}],"bytes":2868,"backlinks":[{"id":"715dbcdaf4fc3a32","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)$；对实际规则集要求 $\\{r\\in\\mathsf R:\\pi_0(r)=\\mathsf{cut}\\}\\subseteq\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma$，后者见 [[72-df-cut-rule]]。其中 $\\pi_0(r)$ 是带标签四元组的首投影；不要求演算包含所有合法 Cut 实例。$\\pi$ 为有限证明。"},{"id":"c75a86bee179cecd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$、$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)$ 为固定无切基础演算，$\\mathsf{cut}$ 不在 $\\mathsf R$ 的标签中。$\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma$、演算扩充和有限证明集分别见 [[72-df-cut-rule]]、[[72-df-gentzen-system]]、[[72-df-proof-tree]]。"},{"id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"06589046e16230e7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cut}_\\Sigma$ 是 [[72-df-cut-rule]] 的不带标签二元实例关系；$\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma$ 才是含切公式见证的带标签规则集。"},{"id":"3af428d306019c10","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cut}_\\Sigma$ 是 [[72-df-cut-rule]] 的不带标签二元实例关系；$\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma$ 才是含切公式见证的带标签规则集。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-cut-rule|df-cut-rule — Cut Rule]]"}],"outgoing":["f9452e4a7788a117","d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","3c073b947b255638"]}